osition:relative;top:-1.5em;left:0.5em;text-align:left;width:6em;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ume%C3%A5_FC\" title=\"Umeå FC\">Umeå</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:64.909173712928%; left:49.968533299139%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4ster%C3%A5s_SK_Fotboll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Västerås SK Fotboll\">Västerås</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:59.115631949577%; left:40.530585271041%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:4px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IK_Brage\" title=\"IK Brage\">Brage</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:77.817958391557%; left:11.01603563534%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rgryte_IS\" title=\"Örgryte IS\">Örgryte</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:83.540306221591%; left:35.690874910527%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em;left:0.5em;text-align:left;width:6em;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Öster</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%\">Geografisk placering av de deltagande lagen i Superettan 2020.</div>\n</div>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Lag_och_arenor\">Lag och arenor</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2020&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Lag och arenor\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2020&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Lag och arenor\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>16 lag är kvalificerade för spel i superettan 2020 efter resultat från <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2019\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2019\">Allsvenskan 2019</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Superettan_2019\" title=\"Superettan 2019\">Superettan 2019</a> och <a href=\"/wiki/Division_1_i_fotboll_f%C3%B6r_herrar_2019\" title=\"Division 1 i fotboll för herrar 2019\">Division 1 2019</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-10\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Nya lag i superettan den här säsongen är <a href=\"/wiki/AFC_Eskilstuna\" title=\"AFC Eskilstuna\">AFC Eskilstuna</a> och <a href=\"/wiki/GIF_Sundsvall\" title=\"GIF Sundsvall\">GIF Sundsvall</a> från Allsvenskan samt <a href=\"/wiki/Akropolis_IF\" title=\"Akropolis IF\">Akropolis IF</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ljungskile_SK\" title=\"Ljungskile SK\">Ljungskile SK</a> och <a href=\"/wiki/Ume%C3%A5_FC\" title=\"Umeå FC\">Umeå FC</a> från Division 1.\n</p><p>Allsvenskanlaget <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96stersunds_FK\" title=\"Östersunds FK\">Östersunds FK</a> förnekades <a href=\"/wiki/Elitlicens\" title=\"Elitlicens\">elitlicens</a> den 26 november 2019 och skulle därmed spela i Superettan denna säsong.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-11\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Deras plats i Allsvenskan skulle istället upptas av Brage som förlorade kvalet mot <a href=\"/wiki/Kalmar_FF\" title=\"Kalmar FF\">Kalmar FF</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-12\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-12\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Östersund överklagade och den 23 december 2019 beslutades att Östersund får elitlicens beviljat och spelar därmed kvar i Allsvenskan denna säsong, vilket innebär att Brage spelar kvar i Superettan denna säsong.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-13\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-13\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>13<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th width=\"130\">Lag\n</th>\n<th width=\"140\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sveriges_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Sveriges län\">Län</a>\n</th>\n<th width=\"100\">Ort\n</th>\n<th>Arena\n</th>\n<th>Underlag\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Kapacitet\n</th>\n<th>Placering<br />2019\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Athletic_FC_Eskilstuna\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Athletic FC Eskilstuna\">AFC Eskilstuna</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/S%C3%B6dermanlands_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Södermanlands län\"><img alt=\"Södermanlands län\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/S%C3%B6dermanlands_vapen.svg/20px-S%C3%B6dermanlands_vapen.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/S%C3%B6dermanlands_vapen.svg/40px-S%C3%B6dermanlands_vapen.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"248\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/S%C3%B6dermanlands_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Södermanlands län\">Södermanland</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Eskilstuna\" title=\"Eskilstuna\">Eskilstuna</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Tunavallen\" title=\"Tunavallen\">Tunavallen</a>\n</td>\n<td>Konstgräs\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;07800.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>7&#160;800\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-14\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-14\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>14<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\" class=\"sortkey\">C &#xfeff;</span><span class=\"sorttext\">16</span> <small>(<a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2019\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2019\">AS</a>)</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Akropolis_IF\" title=\"Akropolis IF\">Akropolis IF</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stockholms_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Stockholms län\"><img alt=\"Stockholms län\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Stockholm_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg/20px-Stockholm_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Stockholm_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg/40px-Stockholm_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"251\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Stockholms_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Stockholms län\">Stockholm</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Stockholm\" title=\"Stockholm\">Stockholm</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Grimsta_IP\" title=\"Grimsta IP\">Grimsta IP</a>\n</td>\n<td>Konstgräs\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"dis