sultat/?scr=table&amp;ftid=77485\">https://web.archive.org/web/20200320081555/https://www2.svenskfotboll.se/cuper-och-serier/spelprogramresultat/?scr=table&amp;ftid=77485</a></span><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">.&#32;Läst 28 oktober 2019</span>.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.btitle=Tabell+och+resultat+Div+1+S%C3%B6dra&amp;rft.atitle=&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fweb.archive.org%2Fweb%2F20200320081555%2Fhttps%3A%2F%2Fwww2.svenskfotboll.se%2Fcuper-och-serier%2Fspelprogramresultat%2F%3Fscr%3Dtable%26ftid%3D77485&amp;rfr&#95;id=info:sid/en.wikipedia.org:Superettan&#95;2020\"><span style=\"display: none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-11\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-11\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r58662249\" /><cite style=\"font-style:normal\" class=\"web\" id=\"CITEREFJohanssonThedéen2019\">Johansson, Malena; Thedéen, Jesper&#32;(26 november 2019).&#32;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.dn.se/sport/fotboll/ostersund-nekas-elitlicens/\">”Östersund får inte elitlicens för spel i allsvenskan”</a>.&#32;<i><span><a href=\"/wiki/Dagens_Nyheter\" title=\"Dagens Nyheter\">Dagens Nyheter</a></span></i><span class=\"printonly\">. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.dn.se/sport/fotboll/ostersund-nekas-elitlicens/\">https://www.dn.se/sport/fotboll/ostersund-nekas-elitlicens/</a></span><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">.&#32;Läst 23 december 2019</span>.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.btitle=%C3%96stersund+f%C3%A5r+inte+elitlicens+f%C3%B6r+spel+i+allsvenskan&amp;rft.atitle=%5B%5BDagens+Nyheter%5D%5D&amp;rft.aulast=Johansson&amp;rft.aufirst=Malena&amp;rft.au=Johansson%2C+Malena&amp;rft.au=Thed%C3%A9en%2C+Jesper&amp;rft.date=26+november+2019&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.dn.se%2Fsport%2Ffotboll%2Fostersund-nekas-elitlicens%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info:sid/en.wikipedia.org:Superettan&#95;2020\"><span style=\"display: none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-12\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-12\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r58662249\" /><cite style=\"font-style:normal\" class=\"web\" id=\"CITEREFGrimlundThedéen2019\">Grimlund, Lars; Thedéen, Jesper&#32;(26 november 2019).&#32;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.dn.se/sport/fotboll/brage-kan-ta-over-ofks-allsvenska-plats-vi-ar-mogna-om-det-skulle-bli-sa/\">”Brage kan ta över ÖFK:s allsvenska plats: ”Vi tackar ja till den vakanta platsen”</a>.&#32;<i><span><a href=\"/wiki/Dagens_Nyheter\" title=\"Dagens Nyheter\">Dagens Nyheter</a></span></i><span class=\"printonly\">. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.dn.se/sport/fotboll/brage-kan-ta-over-ofks-allsvenska-plats-vi-ar-mogna-om-det-skulle-bli-sa/\">https://www.dn.se/sport/fotboll/brage-kan-ta-over-ofks-allsvenska-plats-vi-ar-mogna-om-det-skulle-bli-sa/</a></span><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">.&#32;Läst 23 december 2019</span>.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.btitle=Brage+kan+ta+%C3%B6ver+%C3%96FK%3As+allsvenska+plats%3A+%E2%80%9DVi+tackar+ja+till+den+vakanta+platsen&amp;rft.atitle=%5B%5BDagens+Nyheter%5D%5D&amp;rft.aulast=Grimlund&amp;rft.aufirst=Lars&amp;rft.au=Grimlund%2C+Lars&amp;rft.au=Thed%C3%A9en%2C+Jesper&amp;rft.date=26+november+2019&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.dn.se%2Fsport%2Ffotboll%2Fbrage-kan-ta-over-ofks-allsvenska-plats-vi-ar-mogna-om-det-skulle-bli-sa%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info:sid/en.wikipedia.org:Superettan&#95;2020\"><span style=\"display: none;\">&#160;